# TravelApp Agent - booking services from the supplied iPhone screenshot
# Updated: 2026-11-22
# Policy-free rule list. Recommended initial caller policy: DIRECT.
# Put its caller BEFORE TravelApp if you want a separate agent policy to take effect.
# Seven identified apps; portal-domain baseline, not complete mobile API coverage.
# Journal stays with existing Apple/iCloud routing.
# Red-and-black app labelled Travel is pending identification; no guessed domains.
# Only the visible folder page is included.

